OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's murder trial instructions
OL,4,Awill not be reviewed by court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge's instructions during the trial
OL,7,Fof a teenager who stabbed a
OL,8,Fnine-year-old girl to death will not be
OL,9,Freferred to the Court of Appeal.
OL,11,FAria Thorpe died from a stab wound to
OL,12,Fher heart at her home in
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare in North Somerset on
OL,14,F15 December 2025.
OL,16,FA 16-year-old, who cannot be named due
OL,17,Fto his age, was cleared of her murder
OL,18,Fand manslaughter at Bristol Crown Court
OL,19,Fin June.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
