OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's murder trial instructions
OL,4,Awill not be reviewed by court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal could have been
OL,7,Fasked to review whether there had been
OL,8,Fan error of law which, if so, would be
OL,9,Fclarified to prevent the case
OL,10,Finfluencing future decisions in similar
OL,11,Ftrials. But the Attorney General said
OL,12,Fthe case did not meet the threshold for
OL,13,Freferral.
